sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in Spl.C.C.No.84/2024 pending before the Court of I Addl. District & Sessions Judge, Ramangara, arising out of Crime No.115/2024 registered by Bidadi Police Station, Ramanagara District, for the offences punishable under Sections 376A of IPC, Sections 4(2), 5(j)(ii), 6 & 4(2) of POCSO Act, 2012, subject to the following conditions:
a) Petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
e) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of NC: 2025:KHC:15067 the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
Sd/-
(S VISHWAJITH SHETTY) JUDGE KK Irfan @ Syed Irfan vs State By Sho on 8 April, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/18244854/

